STATISTICAL POWER
======================================================================================================================
  sample: 380 proxy E days in 32 episodes (search 13, holdout 19); 150 real E days in 13 episodes; median episode 10 sessions. Effective independent observations for an E-only rule are the EPISODES, not the days.
